Welcome to the town of Besmirch!

After a short vacation, we're back at work and ready to tackle more bugs, create more content, and participate in exciting events!

This patch addresses some other annoying bugs like:


Crashes during a boss fight;

Issues with going to sleep;

Getting stuck in a cave;

Wrong hitbox size;

Malfunction of audio.




We are currently working on a new demo version that will shift the gameplay! 
It includes, but is not limited to:


Discovering the depths of the mansion;

Innovative farming methods;

Facing unknown enemies;

Unlocking unique items;

A different way to interact with villagers.


Here is a little teaser of what's to come!


[img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45591965/351e8d5667d1ccdce9b664a9152632d5481af714.gif"]



We will see you in the next one!

Hello adventurous farmers! 

 Here's a first patch to fix the most annoying bugs.

In this update, we:

 Fixed the saving system;
 Fixed farming system;
 Fixed chest storage issues;
 Made the enemy attack impossible during conversation;
 Fixed interaction distance;
 Fixed bees going into the tunnel;
 Adjusted inventory slot boundaries;
 Fixed spawning, depth and collisions;
 ...and much more!


Thanks to those changes, "Besmirch Demo" should run more smoothly and will allow for better gameplay!

 What's next

We are currently working on a new "Winter Season"...

https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Grj2AVRXAAE0sy3?format=png&name=small

... as well as taking a deeper look at the Baron's mansion with randomly-generated corridors and rooms. 

https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GrouWHOWcAAvTK2?format=png&name=small



In addition to that, we'll continue to work on any issues that players encounter.

We appreciate you being here, and we'll see you in the next one!
